  "description": "AOT-safe runtime support for typed WIT harnesses emitted by WACS.ComponentModel.Harness.Lib. Carries canonical-ABI memory readers / writers, string lift+lower for UTF-8/UTF-16/Latin1, the WitContract typed model for runtime + compile-time validation, and WitContractMismatchException. No reflection — every type here is callable from harness IL transpiled by NativeAOT or Unity IL2CPP.",
